      "text": "session B (71129188\u2026 \u2014 brand new):\n\"What do you know about me? Weather where I live?\"\nagent: \"Mumbai: 26.4\u00b0C, feels like 30.6\u00b0C \u2014 humid, light wind.\"",
      "fontSize": 18,
