      "originalText": "REMEMBER:\n1. memory outlives the session, the process, even redeploys \u2014 it's a managed service now, not a Python dict\n2. extraction is ASYNC (~30s) \u2014 teach, wait, then ask; querying instantly finds nothing\n3. short-term = checkpoints per session \u00b7 long-term = extracted facts/preferences per ACTOR, shared across all sessions",
